  "details": "Currently, the Group instances are a bit limiting because most events are managed through discord. As such, it's possible most members miss the event because they have not joined each respective group.\n\n**Request:**\n\nAllow users to see friends' group instances, however, clicking those instances takes the user to the group joining screen, allowing them to join/request to join the group directly.\n\nA message explaining that the user needs to join the group to join the instance would be helpful for uninformed users (*\"To join this instance you must first join the group\"*).",
